{"text": "INTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE\n\nMr.\nMr.\nMr.\n\nRe:\n\nWinston Salem. NC. 27102\n\nRIM\n\nApril 22, 1980\n\nG. E. Glover, Jr.\nG. R. Gunzenhauser\nCc. T. Gurkin\n\nStrategic Plan Development\n\nAttached are:\n\nCorporate Mission Statement (Revised 4/17/80)\n\nCorporate Key Issues and Objectives for 1981-1985 Long Range\nStrategic Plan\n\nFinancial Mission Statement\n\nPresentation Format - for use in presenting financial depart-\nment strategic plans to CEO, EVP's, and appropriate VP's/\ndepartment heads on May 15.\n\n1980 Planning Calendar\nare expected to do the following:\n\nBetween now and May 12, Credit, Information Systems, and\nComptroller's should prepare strategies in support of\nCorporate Mission/Corporate Key Issues and Objectives\nincluded in the attachment, bearing in mind our role as\ndescribed in the Financial Mission. In reflecting on your\nown department's strategies, use the Presentation Format as\na guide. Also, Mr. Roger Hill is available to you as a_\nresource; and I would urge your calling on him for help in\ndeveloping strategies, back-up rationale, resource require-\nments, etc.\n\nR.JReynolds Tobacco Company\n\nec90 Se00s",
